\pard \s3\qj\tx0\tx360\tx720\tx1440\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920 
{\plain \tab The Americas division made important strides toward the broad dissemination of its human rights 
information by entirely revamping Human Rights Watch\'92s Spanish-language website.  With materials 
arranged chronologically by country and by issue, the site presented a detailed picture of human rights 
conditions in the region.  The goal was to be comprehensive\'97providing documents that ranged from letters 
to reports to opinion pieces on each country and issue\'97as well as timely\'97effecting the simultaneous release 
in electronic and traditional formats of all of the division\'92s public materials.}{\plain \fs20 \pard \s3\qj\tx0\tx360\tx720\tx1440\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920 
}}